{
  "title": "FrameSource",
  "description": "A source of image frames that change over time - a playing video, a canvas drawn every frame - for a FrameTexture to upload. A frame source is not a renderer and owns no GPU resource. It answers what the current frame is (image, width, height) and whether it changed (revision); the texture uploads a new revision once when a renderer next binds it, however many consumers draw it.",
